    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inanimate nouns in the plural",
     "texto": [
      "With inanimate nouns, the accusative plural matches the nominative plural: **Я читаю книги**; **Я вижу столы**.",
      "The form depends on grammatical animacy: people and animals are animate."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Animate nouns in the plural",
     "texto": [
      "With animate nouns, the accusative plural matches the genitive plural: **Я вижу друзей**, **Я люблю детей**, **Я вижу собак**.",
      "The rule applies to people and animals: compare Я вижу столы and Я вижу собак."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
